      href="/record/sources/kevinkelbie-tracker-update/"
    />
    The circulated fourth wave rests on pattern matching with no
    direct victim confirmation reported; its figures, and the corrections its
    author has published, are <a href="#wave-4">set out below</a> and are not
    part of any total here.
  </p>

  <div class="ve-card ve-card--blue">
